          "name": "Nature Bond",
          "level": 1,
          "type": "archetype",
          "summary": "A serpent shaman who chooses an animal companion must select a snake. If choosing a domain, the serpent shaman must choose from the Animal, Charm, Trickery, and Water domains."
        },
        {
          "id": "druid-serpent-shaman-wild-empathy-ex-1",
